{"title":"Chuandong Xie","markdown":{"yaml":{},"headingText":"Chuandong Xie","containsRefs":false,"markdown":"\n\n<div class=\"home-intro\">\n\n\n**Research Fellow in Structural Engineering, University of Aberdeen**\n\n</div>\n\n::: {.home-content}\n\nI am a structural engineering researcher working at the intersection of resilient structural systems, metal additive manufacturing, structural optimisation, computational mechanics, and data-driven engineering.\n\nI obtained my PhD in Structural Engineering from Xi'an University of Architecture & Technology in 2024. \n\nMy research integrates large-scale experimental testing, finite element analysis, nonlinear dynamics, machine learning and explainable AI to understand structural behaviour and develop resilience-oriented engineering solutions. \n\nI have experience in post-event structural investigation, scientific programming and industry-engaged engineering, alongside university teaching, supervision and interdisciplinary research collaboration.\n\n\n\n\n## Research interests\n\n- Resilient and self-centring structural systems\n- Performance-based seismic deisgn\n- Metal additive manufacturing for structural applications\n- Structural optimisation and generative design\n- Computational mechanics and finite element modelling\n- Machine learning and explainable AI for engineering\n\n:::","srcMarkdownNoYaml":"\n\n<div class=\"home-intro\">\n\n# Chuandong Xie\n\n**Research Fellow in Structural Engineering, University of Aberdeen**\n\n</div>\n\n::: {.home-content}\n\nI am a structural engineering researcher working at the intersection of resilient structural systems, metal additive manufacturing, structural optimisation, computational mechanics, and data-driven engineering.\n\nI obtained my PhD in Structural Engineering from Xi'an University of Architecture & Technology in 2024. \n\nMy research integrates large-scale experimental testing, finite element analysis, nonlinear dynamics, machine learning and explainable AI to understand structural behaviour and develop resilience-oriented engineering solutions. \n\nI have experience in post-event structural investigation, scientific programming and industry-engaged engineering, alongside university teaching, supervision and interdisciplinary research collaboration.\n\n\n\n\n## Research interests\n\n- Resilient and self-centring structural systems\n- Performance-based seismic deisgn\n- Metal additive manufacturing for structural applications\n- Structural optimisation and generative design\n- Computational mechanics and finite element modelling\n- Machine learning and explainable AI for engineering\n\n:::"},"formats":{"html":{"identifier":{"display-name":"HTML","target-format":"html","base-format":"html"},"execute":{"fig-width":7,"fig-height":5,"fig-format":"retina","fig-dpi":96,"df-print":"default","error":false,"eval":true,"cache":null,"freeze":false,"echo":true,"output":true,"warning":true,"include":true,"keep-md":false,"keep-ipynb":false,"ipynb":null,"enabled":null,"daemon":null,"daemon-restart":false,"debug":false,"ipynb-filters":[],"ipynb-shell-interactivity":null,"plotly-connected":true,"engine":"markdown"},"render":{"keep-tex":false,"keep-typ":false,"keep-source":false,"keep-hidden":false,"prefer-html":false,"output-divs":true,"output-ext":"html","fig-align":"default","fig-pos":null,"fig-env":null,"code-fold":"none","code-overflow":"scroll","code-link":false,"code-line-numbers":false,"code-tools":false,"tbl-colwidths":"auto","merge-includes":true,"inline-includes":false,"preserve-yaml":false,"latex-auto-mk":true,"latex-auto-install":true,"latex-clean":true,"latex-min-runs":1,"latex-max-runs":10,"latex-makeindex":"makeindex","latex-makeindex-opts":[],"latex-tlmgr-opts":[],"latex-input-paths":[],"latex-output-dir":null,"link-external-icon":false,"link-external-newwindow":false,"self-contained-math":false,"format-resources":[],"notebook-links":true},"pandoc":{"standalone":true,"wrap":"none","default-image-extension":"png","to":"html"